#: 27b85094213645f988686fd25270b4d6
msgid "Archived: Building for Qualcomm Snapdragon Flight Kit"
msgstr "归档：为 Qualcomm Snapdragon Flight Kit 构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:9
#: c9a874417d1440afb06627d1348b9b29
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**已归档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:11
#: 6001aa2ea4604e64a09c37dec797dfcf
msgid "ArduPilot no longer supports Qualcomm Snapdragon Flight Kit."
msgstr "ArduPilot 不再支持 Qualcomm Snapdragon Flight Kit。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:13
#: 11b21c1c85ad44e3ab1357fdc89b7b8a
msgid ""
"This article shows how to build ArduPilot for :ref:`Qualcomm® Snapdragon "
"Flight™ Kit (Developer’s Edition) <copter:common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-"
"kit>` with *Make* on Linux."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在 Linux 上使用 *Make* 为 :ref:`高通® Snapdragon Flight™ "
"套件（开发者版）<copter:common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit>` 构建 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:19
#: f01c8b4927254efbac35f995b542478b
msgid ""
"Due to some rather unusual licensing terms from Intrinsyc we cannot "
"distribute binaries of ArduPilot (or any program built with the Qualcomm "
"libraries). So you will have to build the firmware yourself."
msgstr ""
"由于 Intrinsyc 的一些特殊许可条款，我们无法分发 ArduPilot（或任何使用高通库构建的程序）的二进制文件。因此你必须自行构建固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:25
#: 87186837c2f14d91bf148a85df9d4fa7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:27
#: 85d0c20a00734d578441aa6f199db2f3
msgid "There are two ports of ArduPilot to this board:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 针对该板有两个移植版本："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:29
#: 5a7f4b0517ba44f2a4814b6ef20ce937
msgid ""
"`QFLIGHT "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/qflight>`__"
" runs mostly on the ARM cores, with just sensor and UARTs on the DSPs. This "
"port is much easier to debug and you can use all of the normal Linux "
"development tools."
msgstr ""
"`QFLIGHT "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_Linux/qflight>`__"
" 主要运行在 ARM 核心上，仅传感器和 UART 在 DSP 上运行。该移植版本更易于调试，可使用所有常规 Linux 开发工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:33
#: 0d28487768ff4de5ae4d7f8e978d6976
msgid ""
"`HAL_QURT "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_QURT/README.md>`__"
" runs primarily on the DSPs, with just a small shim on the ARM cores. This "
"port has better performance due to its extremely accurate realtime "
"scheduling, and is also more robust as it can keep flying if Linux crashes "
"for some reason (the QFLIGHT port relies on both Linux and QURT working to "
"keep flying). However it is harder to debug!"
msgstr ""
"`HAL_QURT "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_QURT/README.md>`__"
" 主要运行在 DSP 上，ARM 核心只有一个小型 shim。该移植版本由于极精确的实时调度而具有更好的性能，并且更为健壮——即使 Linux "
"崩溃也能继续飞行（而 QFLIGHT 移植版本依赖 Linux 和 QURT 同时正常工作）。但它更难调试！"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:40
#: d76b4772cdfb4e09a3283ece12296322
msgid ""
"The build instructions for the two ArduPilot ports are almost exactly the "
"same (both are covered here)."
msgstr "两种 ArduPilot 移植版本的构建说明几乎完全相同（本文均有介绍）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:45
#: ba35b52884904246883322d8b7c63a80
msgid ""
"We recommend that developers use QFLIGHT port for development and debugging,"
" but recompile and target QURT for production use."
msgstr "建议开发者在开发和调试时使用 QFLIGHT 移植版本，但在生产使用时重新编译并针对 QURT 构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:48
#: 4db02fa6e5224c98a6ae49d2b6ea9440
msgid ""
"The instructions in this article demonstrate building for Copter (from the "
"ArduCopter directory). Plane and Rover are build in the same way, from their"
" respective vehicle source directories."
msgstr ""
"本文中的说明以 Copter 的构建为例（在 ArduCopter 目录下）。Plane 和 Rover "
"的构建方式相同，分别在其对应的飞行器源码目录下进行。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:53
#: fddb75870183411bb6b1d2836f9a329a
msgid "Preparing the board"
msgstr "准备板子"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:56
#: db4e12324f29451eb9c80cac9aa32215
msgid "Flashing the OS with QFIL on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上使用 QFIL 刷写操作系统"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:58
#: 2d3307d5b5b94da08ec12fbacf00e3f9
msgid ""
"Boards purchased from Intrinsyc come pre-loaded with an operating system "
"(i.e. Ubuntu) but it may not if you receive a board from a different source."
"  Use the instructions below to flash the OS onto the board from a Windows "
"PC."
msgstr ""
"从 Intrinsyc 购买的板子预装了操作系统（即 Ubuntu），但其他来源的板子可能没有。请按照以下说明从 Windows PC "
"将操作系统刷写到板子上。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:63
#: e891fd441baf404da6c4e3982c64dc6a
msgid ""
"Download and install QFIL (`here <http://androidurdu.net/download-qualcomm-"
"flash-image-loader-qfil/>`__ - search for the green download button with "
"\"QPST 2.7.422\" written below it)."
msgstr ""
"下载并安装 QFIL（`此处 <http://androidurdu.net/download-qualcomm-flash-image-loader-"
"qfil/>`__ — 搜索下方写有「QPST 2.7.422」的绿色下载按钮）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:67
#: 1e763b0c668b49f4bb41c3ee50d97aba
msgid ""
"Put the board into bootloader mode by first powering the board using the "
"power brick and then connect with a USB cable to your PC (note the board has"
" a USB3.0 port but a normal micro USB cable will work)"
msgstr ""
"通过先使用电源砖为板子供电，再用 USB 线连接到电脑的方式，将板子置于 bootloader 模式（注意板子有 USB3.0 接口，但普通的 "
"micro USB 线也适用）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:70
#: e68ad51eb00c4ed283e045f1a708dadc
msgid ""
"Start QFIL and the COM port the board is connected to should automatically "
"appear to the left of the **Select Port** button. Normally it appears with "
"the name \"QDLoader 9008\"."
msgstr ""
"启动 QFIL，板子所连接的 COM 端口应自动出现在 **Select Port** 按钮左侧，通常名称为 「QDLoader 9008」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:73
#: 6694febbd3a94f688d9491e94fdc541a
msgid ""
"Under \"Select Programmer\" click the **Browse** button and find "
"prog_emmc_firehose_8974.mbn (To-Do: which of the packages was this from?)"
msgstr ""
"在 「Select Programmer」下，点击 **Browse** 按钮，找到 "
"prog_emmc_firehose_8974.mbn（待定：该文件来自哪个包？）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:76
#: 93d04ef02a24456785a6c577be52adf5
msgid ""
"Under \"Download\" the rawprogram_unsprse.xml\" should be found "
"automatically (?)"
msgstr "在 「Download」下，rawprogram_unsprse.xml 应该会被自动找到（？）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:78
#: 47a200deebac45db81ddf499de281b46
msgid ""
"Click the **Download** button and if all goes well the OS will be flashed to"
" the board"
msgstr "点击 **Download** 按钮，若一切顺利，操作系统将被刷写到板子上。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:85
#: 194dd97cfa374730ab87e12b532e3dcb
msgid "Connecting to the board using the FTDI cable"
msgstr "使用 FTDI 线连接到板子"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:87
#: 3fb42b29540c43e89f90c937210a8cf2
msgid ""
"The board should come with an FTDI cable and small green serial adapter "
"board which can be plugged into the rectangular black connector on the top "
"of the board next to the USB port.  Use a ssh program such as Putty to "
"connect to the FTDI cable's serial port at 115200 baud (no password is "
"required to log into the board this way)."
msgstr ""
"板子应随附一根 FTDI 线和一块小型绿色串口转接板，可插入板子顶部 USB 口旁边的矩形黑色接口。使用 Putty 等 SSH 程序以 115200 "
"波特率连接到 FTDI 线的串口（以此方式登录板子无需密码）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:94
#: 63a8a7d694374776bb3d09caf8189e22
msgid "Changing the root password and enabling login as root"
msgstr "更改 root 密码并启用 root 登录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:96
#: f9c8b4b2eb944e199ab5b11306c2c0e5
msgid ""
"Connect using the FTDI cable using the instructions above and change the "
"root password by typing ``passwd`` on the command line and entering your "
"desired password twice (ie. \"penguin\")."
msgstr ""
"按上述说明使用 FTDI 线连接，然后在命令行输入 ``passwd``，并两次输入所需密码（如 「penguin」）来更改 root 密码。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:100
#: da16d0425925470791b8ba205a1242d0
msgid ""
"Enable logging in as root by editing /etc/ssh/sshd_config and modifying line"
" 28 to look like below:"
msgstr "通过编辑 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 并将第 28 行修改为如下内容来启用 root 登录："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:103
#: ac97c46413af43c2a3886eda58cc675b
msgid "``PermitRootLogin yes``"
msgstr "``PermitRootLogin yes``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:106
#: 1d1095cf1cb145d882b8fbd8bcd20c48
msgid "Connecting to the board's wifi access point"
msgstr "连接到板子的 wifi 热点"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:108
#: ab988ff43fdd4006bbc1ffdbd15d945a
msgid ""
"The board's wifi access point will appear as ssid \"Atlanticus_XXXXX\" "
"(where X is a 5 digit number) and password \"password\"."
msgstr "板子的 wifi 热点名称为 「Atlanticus_XXXXX」（X 为 5 位数字），密码为 「password」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:111
#: b24d48d4922c4a7bab7afcf79db1fb33
msgid ""
"The IP address assigned to your computer (default range is 192.168.1.10 ~ "
"192.168.1.20) can be changed by modifying the files below.  This may be "
"necessary to avoid conflicting with your home/business wifi network."
msgstr ""
"分配给你的电脑的 IP 地址（默认范围为 192.168.1.10 ~ "
"192.168.1.20）可通过修改以下文件进行更改。这可能有必要，以避免与家庭/办公 wifi 网络冲突。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:115
#: 65ac9ffc98424b0db363739686d07df1
msgid "Lines 304, 305 of /etc/dnsmasq.conf as shown below."
msgstr "/etc/dnsmasq.conf 的第 304、305 行，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:117
#: 02b420db0eb64065a167d1fa24d029d6
msgid "``interface=wlan0``"
msgstr "``interface=wlan0``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:119
#: e9488dc8653e4270a0d6607e2ba13d4c
msgid "dhcp-range=192.168.**2**.10,192.168.**2**.20,infinite"
msgstr "dhcp-range=192.168.**2**.10,192.168.**2**.20,infinite"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:121
#: 9761eba8511644c5ad5fcac9929d3309
msgid ""
"Line 39 of /etc/network/interfaces.d/.qca6234.cfg.softap as shown below."
msgstr "/etc/network/interfaces.d/.qca6234.cfg.softap 的第 39 行，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:123
#: 585e274a713c41cdaf47d85ffd2398f7
msgid "`` address 192.168.2.1``"
msgstr "`` address 192.168.2.1``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:125
#: 2ddbfafbc6314af98b3252e31cbfb689
msgid ""
"You should be able to use a terminal program such as Putty to ssh to the "
"board at the IP address shown above (i.e. 192.168.2.1) using user/password "
"of linaro/linaro or root/penguin."
msgstr ""
"你应该可以使用 Putty 等终端程序通过 SSH 连接到上述 IP 地址（如 192.168.2.1），用户名/密码为 linaro/linaro 或"
" root/penguin。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:130
#: def632641b9c440faa927f60792fd07e
msgid "Correct home directory permissions"
msgstr "修正 home 目录权限"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:132
#: da3aed1821ff43829b2807fbca0ff7a8
msgid "By default the /home/linaro directory permission are incorrect."
msgstr "默认情况下 /home/linaro 目录的权限设置不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:134
#: 52e3b9ec06a44feba3dad68f779ba03b
msgid "``sudo chown -R linaro.linaro /home/linaro``"
msgstr "``sudo chown -R linaro.linaro /home/linaro``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:137
#: 7f008f4e998843a785a5ce106b1856e0
msgid "Create a logs directory"
msgstr "创建日志目录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:139
#: f1760f05024f42d4bd7a7188b34034bc
msgid ""
"On the flight board, create the logs directory in a location where the DSPs "
"can write to:"
msgstr "在飞行控制板上，在 DSP 可写入的位置创建 logs 目录："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:142
#: 1f37c6ce08854fd08a7e07f408cf2572
msgid "``mkdir /usr/share/data/adsp/logs``"
msgstr "``mkdir /usr/share/data/adsp/logs``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:145
#: 80b5037d1c69478b829c2e415107dbb5
msgid "Checking and upgrading the Ubuntu kernel version on the board"
msgstr "检查并升级板子上的 Ubuntu 内核版本"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:147
#: 0be9ad901ba04e3f92bfa3112702c881
msgid ""
"Connect to the board using the FTDI cable or ssh via sifi can type \"uname "
"-a\".  The output should appear as below (or with a later date), if it does "
"not then it should be updated."
msgstr ""
"通过 FTDI 线连接或通过 wifi 进行 SSH 后，输入 「uname -a」。输出应如下所示（或显示更新的日期），如果不同则需要更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:151
#: 75d0db792a864f8180972139d0917407
msgid ""
"``Linux linaro-developer 3.4.0-eagle8074 #1 SMP PREEMPT Wed Dec 9 17:42:13 "
"PST 2015 armv7l armv7l armv7l GNU/Linux``"
msgstr ""
"``Linux linaro-developer 3.4.0-eagle8074 #1 SMP PREEMPT Wed Dec 9 17:42:13 "
"PST 2015 armv7l armv7l armv7l GNU/Linux``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:153
#: 98d7b64ea0d048ff89b8d65abd4ec384
msgid ""
"To upgrade to a later version of Ubuntu first `download and extract the "
"latest \"Flight_BSP_X.X\" file from the Intrinsic site (Note: these files "
"had at least temporarily disappeared as of Jan-2016). "
"<http://support.intrinsyc.com/projects/snapdragon-flight/files?val=1>`__"
msgstr ""
"要升级到更新版本的 Ubuntu，请先`下载并解压 Intrinsic 网站上的最新「Flight_BSP_X.X」文件（注意：这些文件在 2016 年"
" 1 月前后曾至少短暂消失）。<http://support.intrinsyc.com/projects/snapdragon-"
"flight/files?val=1>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:159
#: ef3cf70d6db64cbd8a10fa159fe253eb
msgid "Upgrade using the fastboot-all script:"
msgstr "使用 fastboot-all 脚本升级："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:161
#: 9a857971631441dbb8614a3d5860380a
msgid ""
"On an Ubuntu machine find the Binaries/fastboot-all.bat script from the "
"above download."
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 机器上找到上述下载文件中的 Binaries/fastboot-all.bat 脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:164
#: 7337a3b5884141fa8fefb34e278b247d
msgid ""
"Edit the script and remove the reboot line (line 16) which is shown below "
"(this reboot can cause the board to become bricked if the upgrade fails)"
msgstr "编辑脚本并删除第 16 行（如下所示），因为如果升级失败，该 reboot 命令可能导致板子变砖。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:168
#: 8e1ba2992b924e7b982ec6fd678468a3
msgid "``fastboot reboot``"
msgstr "``fastboot reboot``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:170
#: c17ed51252724808a934894cab01991c
msgid "Run the script:"
msgstr "运行脚本："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:172
#: 9fcee1bb1a7642da99a99622ddb1aaff
msgid "``sudo ./Binaries/fastboot-all.bat``"
msgstr "``sudo ./Binaries/fastboot-all.bat``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:174
#: 893a56d90eec4446aa1b2491ace58ea1
msgid ""
"After the upgrade, the board will be completely wiped meaning any previous "
"setup (i.e. root passwords, wifi IP addresses) will need to be redone."
msgstr "升级后，板子将被完全清空，之前的所有配置（如 root 密码、wifi IP 地址）均需重新设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:178
#: b4a2323511b0451a941b5e8f94c42dfa
msgid ""
"Note: On 25-Jan-2016, while after performing this upgrade and writing this "
"wiki page we found the /firmware/image was out of date.  We should add "
"instructions on which files needed to be updated and where the new files can"
" be found."
msgstr ""
"注意：2016 年 1 月 25 日，在完成此次升级并编写本 wiki 页面后，我们发现 /firmware/image "
"已过时。我们应补充说明哪些文件需要更新，以及新文件的下载位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:184
#: 07351a6da0be4fadb7d573aa24c868c6
msgid "Upgrade by manually copying images"
msgstr "通过手动复制镜像升级"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:186
#: 7193f24b4bc347f1a5cdc79108a8b655
msgid ""
"extract the contents of the above zip and find the following files in the "
"Binaries directory"
msgstr "解压上述 zip 文件，在 Binaries 目录中找到以下文件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:189
#: aabd1d57ec274f6bb086489f3ff0a973
msgid "boot.img, cache.img, persist.img, system.img"
msgstr "boot.img, cache.img, persist.img, system.img"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:191
#: 885317b0bb444c6ba1ed4647937e9374
msgid "on an Ubuntu machine, unpack 3 of the 4 images:"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 机器上解包其中 3 个镜像："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:193
#: 52103c2db0974f5db9f8628ec27dea87
msgid "simg2img cache.img cache.ext4"
msgstr "simg2img cache.img cache.ext4"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:194
#: 064229bd1e0b48d2aa2125f55054f4f0
msgid "simg2img persist.img persist.ext4"
msgstr "simg2img persist.img persist.ext4"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:195
#: 572b1a406aae44379b16ad6bb294e2f6
