#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:225
#: 023b5beef6f34db5a2c8e008bbc921a7
msgid "Edit dangerous Q6 service startup script"
msgstr "编辑危险的 Q6 服务启动脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:227
#: 52c73d3380b14a4aa80f5c4a8c8af4bf
msgid ""
"On the flight board, edit /etc/init/q6.conf script and comment out the line "
"below which, if left in place, can cause the board to stall forever during "
"the boot up process is \"q6\" fails to start"
msgstr ""
"在飞行控制板上，编辑 /etc/init/q6.conf 脚本，注释掉以下这行——如果保留，当 「q6」启动失败时，可能导致板子在启动过程中永久卡住。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:231
#: 4bd612866e50479cba7b8967a5ebc57b
msgid ""
"``#watch -n 1 --precise -g grep -m 1 \"2\" /sys/kernel/debug/msm_subsys/adsp"
" && true``"
msgstr ""
"``#watch -n 1 --precise -g grep -m 1 「2」 /sys/kernel/debug/msm_subsys/adsp "
"&& true``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:234
#: 8221b3b23a8d4eedac2432c499341432
msgid "Putting the board in to \"Storage mode\""
msgstr "将板子置于「存储模式」"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:236
#: 326c1f4a0a3e425e98a8f44f794a4d69
msgid ""
"During the upgrade process, if the above step is skipped, it is possible to "
"get the board into a state where it will not completely boot up.  You will "
"be unable to login using FTDI or wifi.  If this occurs you can exploit a "
"race condition in the startup sequence to get the board in \"storage mode\" "
"which allows accessing the disks on the board."
msgstr ""
"在升级过程中，如果跳过了上述步骤，板子可能进入无法完全启动的状态，也无法通过 FTDI 或 wifi "
"登录。此时可以利用启动序列中的竞争条件，将板子置于「存储模式」，从而访问板子上的磁盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:242
#: 625f798aec4b4a2ba1771f4248b93ba9
msgid "first ensure both power and usb cables are disconnected"
msgstr "首先确保电源线和 USB 线均已断开"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:243
#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:246
#: bf3dfac8a28d428c81f1674aa01909a0 f4849b9ad86548b68a25b2bc977c0112
msgid "plug in the power"
msgstr "插入电源"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:244
#: 6d05b871b01c45f78b8c11778c97a284
msgid "quickly plug in the usb"
msgstr "迅速插入 USB 线"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:245
#: a0b97b08e40848cd8df8dccf648cdfed
msgid "disconnect the power brick, hopefully the led will turn red"
msgstr "断开电源砖，此时 LED 有望变为红色"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:248
#: 7365b880c40e4d0f99351c6e21060ed0
msgid ""
"If all goes well, 10 or 20 disk devices will appear on the Windows or Ubuntu"
" machine connected via USB.  The files on the disk can be edited including "
"perhaps editing the startup scripts to resolve the boot-up issue."
msgstr ""
"若一切顺利，通过 USB 连接的 Windows 或 Ubuntu 机器上将出现 10 或 20 "
"个磁盘设备，可以编辑磁盘上的文件，包括修改启动脚本以解决启动问题。"

